## 2. Core Features (MVP scope)

**Auth & Onboarding**
- Email/password + Google SSO (FR-01)
- 5-step wizard: profile → asset upload → integrations (OAuth stubs) → past-attempts log → primary goal (FR-02 → FR-06)
- Asset Vault: pdf/pptx/docx/png/jpg/csv ≤ 50MB, text + image extraction (FR-03)

**CMO Strategic Layer**
- Forensic Audit on first complete onboarding → **Truth Report** in ≤ 90s with 3–7 ranked loopholes (FR-07, FR-08)
- 30-day Strategy Plan, editable (FR-11)
- **Critique Loop**: every user request checked vs goal / market data / failure log; "I disagree — here's why" UI with Override (logged); 3-override nudge (FR-09, FR-10)

**Tactical Agents (5)** — SEO Architect, SMM Specialist, Growth BDM, Graphic Designer, Data Analyst
- Each: structured system-prompt envelope (persona, north_star, hard_rules, tools, memory_scope) — FR-12
- Task queue per agent, parallel execution, outputs flow to **QC Loop** then **Approval Queue**
- Cross-Pollination: agents read peers' *outputs* (not reasoning); CMO brokers all agent-to-agent comms
- Immutable `action_log`

**User Workspace Screens**
1. Sign up · 2. Plan select ($99/$199) · 3. Onboarding wizard · 4. Audit loader · 5. Truth Report · 6. Command Center · 7. War Room chat with CMO · 8. Live Agent Activity · 9. Asset Library · 10. Approval Queue · 11. Weekly Stop/Start/Continue report · 12. Settings/Billing

**Billing & Plans**
- Two tiers + add-on logic (Solo +$30/agent, auto-upgrade prompt at 4 agents)
- 14-day trial, no CC; Truth Report is the conversion hook
- Pause-not-cancel (50% off 1 mo)

**Non-functional**
- RLS everywhere (workspace_id scoping), service-role only in server routes
- Plain-English copy mandate (no marketing jargon in UI)
- Multi-workspace (Agency Anna) — schema-ready, UI surfaced Phase 2

