## 4. Agent Execution Plan (Lovable subagent orchestration)

Phase 2 will spawn these as **parallel `spawn_agent` subagents**; each owns a non-overlapping file scope so they cannot conflict. Sequencing has one strict gate.

**Wave 0 — Foundation (sequential, I do this first)**
- Enable Lovable Cloud
- Migration: full schema above + GRANTs + RLS policies + `has_role()`
- Seed: agent definitions, default system prompts
- Route shell: `__root.tsx`, `_authenticated.tsx`, design tokens

**Wave 1 — Parallel build (4 concurrent subagents)**

| Subagent | Scope (files only it touches) | Deliverable |
|---|---|---|
| **A. Auth & Onboarding** | `src/routes/(auth)/*`, `src/routes/_authenticated/onboarding/*`, `src/lib/onboarding.functions.ts` | Sign up, plan select, 5-step wizard, asset upload to Storage, goal parser serverFn |
| **B. CMO Engine** | `src/lib/cmo/*.functions.ts`, `src/lib/cmo/*.server.ts`, `src/routes/_authenticated/truth-report.tsx` | Forensic Audit job, Truth Report generation, Critique Loop evaluator, Strategy Plan builder (all via AI Gateway) |
| **C. Agents & Workspace UI** | `src/routes/_authenticated/(command|war-room|agents|approvals|assets)/*`, `src/components/agents/*` | Command Center, War Room chat, Live Activity, Approval Queue, Asset Library |
| **D. QA & Seed** | `src/lib/__tests__/*`, `scripts/seed-demo.ts` | Vitest for critique-loop logic + RLS smoke tests; demo workspace seed for verification |

**Wave 2 — Integration (sequential, me)**
