- Stripe checkout + webhook at `/api/public/stripe-webhook` with signature verification
- End-to-end verification: seeded user → onboarding → audit → Truth Report → approve loophole → tasks generated → approve asset → action_log entry

**Verification artifacts (delivered at end of Phase 2)**
